OL,3,ANvidia shares soar as Jensen Huang
OL,4,Areinstated as CEO, days after quitting
OL,5,Aover affair with alleged spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia's board votes unanimously to
OL,8,Freinstate Jensen Huang as CEO and
OL,9,Fpresident
OL,11,FHe stepped down earlier this month,
OL,12,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman
OL,13,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -
OL,14,Fhe was also accused of an affair with
OL,15,Fan Nvidia executive
OL,17,FThe AI giant's board says he's the
OL,18,F"right person" to lead, and his return
OL,19,Fis in "the best interests of our
OL,20,Fstockholders, employees, partners and
OL,21,Fcustomers"
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
